{"module":"grammar","item":{"id":"a2-grammar-stellen-stehen","level":"A2","topic":"Verben","title":{"de":"stellen/stehen, legen/liegen, setzen/sitzen, hängen","bn":"রাখা আর থাকা: stellen/stehen, legen/liegen"},"summary":"রাখার কাজ (stellen, legen, setzen, hängen) + Akkusativ; থাকা (stehen, liegen, sitzen, hängen) + Dativ।","intro":[{"kind":"text","text":"বাংলায় আমরা শুধু বলি „রাখা“ আর „আছে“। জার্মানে জিনিসটি খাড়া, শোয়ানো, বসা নাকি ঝুলন্ত—সেই অনুযায়ী আলাদা verb লাগে।"}],"sections":[{"heading":"১. রাখা আর থাকা","blocks":[{"kind":"table","rows":[["রাখা (Wohin? + Akkusativ)","থাকা (Wo? + Dativ)","কেমন করে?"],["stellen","stehen","খাড়া করে"],["legen","liegen","শুইয়ে"],["setzen","sitzen","বসিয়ে"],["hängen","hängen","ঝুলিয়ে"]]},{"kind":"text","text":"বাম দিকের verb-গুলো কাজ (কিছু রাখা), এদের পরে Akkusativ। ডান দিকের verb-গুলো অবস্থা (কোথাও আছে), এদের পরে Dativ।"}]},{"heading":"২. উদাহরণ","blocks":[{"kind":"text","text":"stellen / stehen — খাড়া জিনিস (বোতল, আলমারি, চেয়ার):"},{"kind":"examples","items":[{"de":"Ich stelle die Flasche auf den Tisch.","bn":"আমি বোতলটি টেবিলের ওপর রাখি।"},{"de":"Die Flasche steht auf dem Tisch.","bn":"বোতলটি টেবিলের ওপর আছে।"}]},{"kind":"text","text":"legen / liegen — শোয়ানো জিনিস (বই, ফোন, চাবি):"},{"kind":"examples","items":[{"de":"Ich lege das Handy auf das Sofa.","bn":"আমি ফোনটি সোফার ওপর রাখি।"},{"de":"Das Handy liegt auf dem Sofa.","bn":"ফোনটি সোফার ওপর আছে।"}]},{"kind":"text","text":"setzen / sitzen — বসা:"},{"kind":"examples","items":[{"de":"Die Mutter setzt das Kind auf den Stuhl.","bn":"মা শিশুটিকে চেয়ারে বসান।"},{"de":"Das Kind sitzt auf dem Stuhl.","bn":"শিশুটি চেয়ারে বসে আছে।"}]},{"kind":"text","text":"hängen / hängen — ঝোলানো (দুই অর্থেই একই verb):"},{"kind":"examples","items":[{"de":"Ich hänge die Jacke in den Schrank.","bn":"আমি জ্যাকেটটি আলমারিতে ঝুলিয়ে রাখি।"},{"de":"Die Jacke hängt im Schrank.","bn":"জ্যাকেটটি আলমারিতে ঝুলছে।"}]},{"kind":"text","text":"মনে রাখবে: কাজ (stellen, legen, setzen, hängen) → Akkusativ। অবস্থা (stehen, liegen, sitzen, hängen) → Dativ।"}]}],"test":[{"id":"a2-grammar-stellen-stehen-t1","type":"mcq","prompt":"Das Buch ___ auf dem Tisch. (শোয়ানো আছে)","options":["legt","liegt","steht"],"answer":1,"explanation":"শোয়ানো অবস্থায় আছে: liegen → liegt।"},{"id":"a2-grammar-stellen-stehen-t2","type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich ___ die Flasche auf den Tisch. (খাড়া করে রাখি)","options":["stelle","stehe","lege"],"answer":0,"explanation":"খাড়া করে রাখা: stellen।"},{"id":"a2-grammar-stellen-stehen-t3","type":"mcq","prompt":"Die Flasche steht auf ___ Tisch.","options":["den","dem","das"],"answer":1,"explanation":"stehen = অবস্থা → Dativ: dem Tisch।"},{"id":"a2-grammar-stellen-stehen-t4","type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich lege das Handy auf ___ Sofa.","options":["dem","das","der"],"answer":1,"explanation":"legen = রাখার কাজ → Akkusativ: das Sofa।"},{"id":"a2-grammar-stellen-stehen-t5","type":"mcq","prompt":"Das Kind ___ auf dem Stuhl. (বসে আছে)","options":["setzt","sitzt","stellt"],"answer":1,"explanation":"বসে আছে = sitzen → sitzt।"},{"id":"a2-grammar-stellen-stehen-t6","type":"mcq","prompt":"Die Jacke hängt ___ Schrank.","options":["im","in den","ins"],"answer":0,"explanation":"অবস্থা → Dativ: in dem = im।"},{"id":"a2-grammar-stellen-stehen-t7","type":"mcq","prompt":"কোনটি „রাখার কাজ“ বোঝায়?","options":["liegen","legen","sitzen"],"answer":1,"explanation":"legen = রাখা; liegen = আছে।"},{"id":"a2-grammar-stellen-stehen-t8","type":"mcq","prompt":"stehen, liegen, sitzen-এর পরে কোন case?","options":["Dativ","Akkusativ","Nominativ"],"answer":0,"explanation":"এগুলো অবস্থা বোঝায় (Wo?) → Dativ।"}]},"schema":1,"id":"a2-grammar-stellen-stehen","level":"A2","test":[{"id":"a2-grammar-stellen-stehen-t1","type":"mcq","prompt":"Das Buch ___ auf dem Tisch. (শোয়ানো আছে)","options":["legt","liegt","steht"],"answer":1,"explanation":"শোয়ানো অবস্থায় আছে: liegen → liegt।"},{"id":"a2-grammar-stellen-stehen-t2","type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich ___ die Flasche auf den Tisch. (খাড়া করে রাখি)","options":["stelle","stehe","lege"],"answer":0,"explanation":"খাড়া করে রাখা: stellen।"},{"id":"a2-grammar-stellen-stehen-t3","type":"mcq","prompt":"Die Flasche steht auf ___ Tisch.","options":["den","dem","das"],"answer":1,"explanation":"stehen = অবস্থা → Dativ: dem Tisch।"},{"id":"a2-grammar-stellen-stehen-t4","type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich lege das Handy auf ___ Sofa.","options":["dem","das","der"],"answer":1,"explanation":"legen = রাখার কাজ → Akkusativ: das Sofa।"},{"id":"a2-grammar-stellen-stehen-t5","type":"mcq","prompt":"Das Kind ___ auf dem Stuhl. (বসে আছে)","options":["setzt","sitzt","stellt"],"answer":1,"explanation":"বসে আছে = sitzen → sitzt।"},{"id":"a2-grammar-stellen-stehen-t6","type":"mcq","prompt":"Die Jacke hängt ___ Schrank.","options":["im","in den","ins"],"answer":0,"explanation":"অবস্থা → Dativ: in dem = im।"},{"id":"a2-grammar-stellen-stehen-t7","type":"mcq","prompt":"কোনটি „রাখার কাজ“ বোঝায়?","options":["liegen","legen","sitzen"],"answer":1,"explanation":"legen = রাখা; liegen = আছে।"},{"id":"a2-grammar-stellen-stehen-t8","type":"mcq","prompt":"stehen, liegen, sitzen-এর পরে কোন case?","options":["Dativ","Akkusativ","Nominativ"],"answer":0,"explanation":"এগুলো অবস্থা বোঝায় (Wo?) → Dativ।"}]}